    },
    {
      "speaker": "p2",
      "to": null,
      "stance": "neu",
      "cue": "CAMERON",
      "quote": "It was a good year for corn.",
      "block": 14
    },
    {
      "speaker": "p2",
      "to": null,
      "stance": "neu",
      "cue": "CAMERON",
      "quote": "You take much fur?",
      "block": 15
    },
    {
      "speaker": "p5",
      "to": null,
      "stance": "neu",
      "cue": "JACK",
      "quote": "Tradin' your skins in Castleton?",
      "block": 16
    },
    {
      "speaker": "p3",
      "to": "p5",
      "stance": "neu",
      "cue": "HAWKEYE",
      "quote": "So what is it, Jack? What brings you up here?",
      "block": 17
    },
    {
      "speaker": "p3",
      "to": null,
      "stance": "neu",
      "cue": "HAWKEYE",
      "quote": "Folks here goin' to join in that fight?",
      "block": 18
    },
    {
      "speaker": "p5",
      "to": null,
      "stance": "neu",
      "cue": "JACK",
      "quote": "We'll see in the morning ...",
      "block": 19
    },
    {
      "speaker": "p5",
      "to": null,
      "stance": "neu",
      "cue": "JACK",
      "quote": "Few'd deny that? Where you headin'?",
      "block": 20
    },
    {
      "speaker": "p6",
      "to": null,
      "stance": "neu",
      "cue": "JAMES",
      "quote": "A son like me?",
      "block": 21
    },
    {
      "speaker": "p7",
      "to": null,
      "stance": "neu",
      "cue": "ALEXANDRIA",
      "quote": "That's what he's doin' to his mama ...",
      "block": 22
    },
    {
      "speaker": "p8",
      "to": null,
      "stance": "neu",
      "cue": "IAN",
      "quote": "How far up the valley?",
      "block": 23
    },
    {
      "speaker": "p9",
      "to": "p8",
      "stance": "ally",
      "cue": "LIEUTENANT",
      "quote": "To Fort William Henry.",
      "block": 24
    },
    {
      "speaker": "p10",
      "to": "p9",
      "stance": "ally",
      "cue": "COLONIAL #1",
      "quote": "... two days from here.",
      "block": 25
    },
    {
      "speaker": "p9",
      "to": "p10",
      "stance": "ally",
      "cue": "LIEUTENANT",
      "quote": "It should be enough to remind you France is \n\t\t\tthe enemy.",
      "block": 26
    },
    {
      "speaker": "p3",
      "to": "p9",
      "stance": "neu",
      "cue": "HAWKEYE",
      "quote": "Your enemy ...",
      "block": 27
    },
    {
      "speaker": "p9",
      "to": "p3",
      "stance": "neu",
      "cue": "LIEUTENANT",
      "quote": "What did you say?",
      "block": 28
    },
    {
      "speaker": "p3",
      "to": "p9",
      "stance": "neu",
      "cue": "HAWKEYE",
      "quote": "I said ... France is your enemy. Not ours.",
      "block": 29
    },
    {
      "speaker": "p9",
      "to": "p3",
      "stance": "neu",
      "cue": "LIEUTENANT",
      "quote": "Really? Do you want them to overrun all \n\t\t\tNew York colony?",
      "block": 30
    },
    {
      "speaker": "p9",
      "to": "p3",
      "stance": "neu",
      "cue": "LIEUTENANT",
      "quote": "Will you men help us stop the French?",
      "block": 31
    },
    {
      "speaker": "p3",
      "to": "p9",
      "stance": "neu",
      "cue": "HAWKEYE",
      "quote": "... and while they are cooped up in your fort, \n\t\t\twhat if the French send war parties to raid \n\t\t\ttheir homes?",
      "block": 32
    },
    {
      "speaker": "p8",
      "to": "p9",
      "stance": "neu",
      "cue": "IAN",
      "quote": "What then, Lieutenant?",
      "block": 33
    },
    {
      "speaker": "p9",
      "to": "p8",
      "stance": "neu",
      "cue": "LIEUTENANT",
      "quote": "For your own homes, for king, for country, that's \n\t\t\twhy you men ought to join this fight!",
      "block": 34
    },
    {
      "speaker": "p3",
      "to": "p9",
      "stance": "opp",
      "cue": "HAWKEYE",
      "quote": "You do what you want with your own scalp.\n\t\t\tDo not be tellin' us what to do\n\t\t\twith ours.",
      "block": 35
    },
    {
      "speaker": "p9",
      "to": "p3",
      "stance": "opp",
      "cue": "LIEUTENANT",
      "quote": "You, sir! You call yourself a loyal subject?",
      "block": 36
    },
    {
      "speaker": "p3",
      "to": "p9",
      "stance": "opp",
      "cue": "HAWKEYE",
      "quote": "... No ... Do not call myself much of a subject \n\t\t\tat all.",
      "block": 37
    },
    {
      "speaker": "p11",
      "to": null,
      "stance": "neu",
      "cue": "COLONIAL #2",
      "quote": "Nathaniel's right. But if I got to fight, figure I'll \n\t\t\ttry and do it fifty miles north of here instead of \n\t\t\tmy bean field.",
      "block": 38
    },
    {
      "speaker": "p12",
      "to": null,
      "stance": "neu",
      "cue": "AD LIBS",
      "quote": "Yes. Yeah. No ...",
      "block": 39
    },
    {
      "speaker": "p2",
      "to": null,
      "stance": "neu",
      "cue": "CAMERON",
      "quote": "I am stayin' on my farm. And any man who goes,\n\t\t\this family is welcome to fort-up with us 'til he \n\t\t\tcomes back.",
      "block": 40
    },
    {
      "speaker": "p5",
      "to": null,
      "stance": "neu",
      "cue": "JACK",
      "quote": "Boys. My sense of it is enough of us will join-up to \n\t\t\tfill the county's levy. But only if General Webb \n\t\t\taccepts a few terms I got in mind ...",
      "block": 41
    },
    {
      "speaker": "p12",
      "to": "p5",
      "stance": "neu",
      "cue": "AD LIBS",
      "quote": "Webb? what's that, Jack ...?",
      "block": 42
    },
    {
      "speaker": "p8",
      "to": null,
      "stance": "neu",
      "cue": "IAN",
      "quote": "You boys marchin' with us? What do you say?",
      "block": 43
